{"unit_id":"DC-507__dsh-zoom#card-zh","repo":"DC-507/dsh-zoom","commit":"4c3c857a2220f8ae20c474e0787b2070bf0f8fce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zoom 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的整体界面缩放插件，通过浏览器端模块在页面根元素应用 CSS 缩放，并在启用时恢复已保存的级别。用户可用 Cmd/Ctrl 加等号逐级放大、加减号缩小、加零恢复原始比例；缩放级别保存在本地，重启后继续使用。模块还会调整少数视口高度限制，并在改变比例时触发窗口 resize。适合需要放大侧栏、菜单、设置和对话界面的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:101-125","lib/client.js:201-212"]}
{"unit_id":"DC-507__dsh-zoom#card-en","repo":"DC-507/dsh-zoom","commit":"4c3c857a2220f8ae20c474e0787b2070bf0f8fce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-zoom adds keyboard controlled zoom to the DSH web interface. Cmd/Ctrl plus equals zooms in, minus zooms out, and zero resets to 100%. It applies CSS zoom to the page root and saves the level locally for restoration. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:101-125","lib/client.js:201-212"]}
