{"unit_id":"DC-507__dsh-zoom#feature-root-zoom","repo":"DC-507/dsh-zoom","commit":"4c3c857a2220f8ae20c474e0787b2070bf0f8fce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zoom 的功能「整体界面缩放」：在页面根元素应用 CSS zoom，调整侧栏、菜单、设置和对话的显示比例。按 Cmd/Ctrl 加等号或减号逐档缩放，按零恢复 100%。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:101-107","lib/client.js:170-189"]}
{"unit_id":"DC-507__dsh-zoom#feature-persist","repo":"DC-507/dsh-zoom","commit":"4c3c857a2220f8ae20c474e0787b2070bf0f8fce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zoom 的功能「记住缩放级别」：每次更改后把比例写入浏览器 localStorage，启用时读取并恢复；无效值或存储不可用时回到默认比例。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:22-40","lib/client.js:116-125","lib/client.js:201-202"]}
