{"unit_id":"DC-507__dsh-zoom#feature-cleanup","repo":"DC-507/dsh-zoom","commit":"4c3c857a2220f8ae20c474e0787b2070bf0f8fce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zoom 的功能「卸载时清理」：插件上下文结束时移除键盘监听、根元素缩放样式、补丁样式标签和调试句柄。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:210-221"]}
{"unit_id":"DC-507__dsh-zoom#caveat-browser-shortcut","repo":"DC-507/dsh-zoom","commit":"4c3c857a2220f8ae20c474e0787b2070bf0f8fce","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-zoom 使用 Cmd/Ctrl 加等号、减号和零处理缩放，并会阻止这些快捷键继续传播；普通浏览器中可能替代浏览器自身页面缩放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:170-189"]}
